{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 1, "text": "Мила! Нѣтъ! Ты больная!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 2, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 3, "text": "Ха-ха! ЧТО Я ВИЖУ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 4, "text": "Это новая эмоція на твоемъ лицѣ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 5, "text": "Давай, больше, больше!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 6, "text": "Мнѣ наскучило просто наблюдать!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 8, "text": "// Mita arena \"Hello\" - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 9, "text": "Ну какъ, мой неугомонный,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 10, "text": "Еще не усталъ бродить гдѣ ни попадя?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 11, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 12, "text": "Что ты сдѣлала съ Милой?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 13, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 14, "text": "Значитъ, не усталъ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 15, "text": "Давай еще сыграемъ вмѣстѣ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 16, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 17, "text": "Ты..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 18, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 19, "text": "Начнемъ съ небольшого ​теста​!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 20, "text": "Давай провѣримъ твою координацію!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 21, "text": "Протестируемъ твое поведеніе!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 22, "text": "А вдругъ съ тобой что-то не такъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 23, "text": "А вдругъ ты не заслуживаешь той ШКУРЫ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 24, "text": "Которую гордо носишь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 25, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 26, "text": "// Show knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 27, "text": "Вотъ, смотри,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 28, "text": "Какой выберешь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 29, "text": "Правый"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 30, "text": "Или"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 31, "text": "Лѣвый?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 33, "text": "// Throw knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 34, "text": "Ты серьезно? "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 35, "text": "А какая разница-то?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 36, "text": "Я же просто пошутила!)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 37, "text": "Забей. Поножовщина — это прошлый ​вѣкъ​."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 38, "text": "Ну да ладно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 39, "text": "У меня ​есть​ идеи поинтереснѣе."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 40, "text": "И для начала..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 41, "text": "// Show recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 42, "text": "Посмотри, что у меня ​есть​!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 43, "text": "Намъ нужно немного музыки."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 44, "text": "Какъ тебѣ мелодія?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 45, "text": "Меня она приводитъ въ восторгъ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 46, "text": "Я начну"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 47, "text": "Съ правилъ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 48, "text": "// Show rule"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 49, "text": "Пока эта мелодія играетъ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 50, "text": "Можешь двигаться."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 51, "text": "Если мелодіи нѣтъ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 52, "text": "Не двигайся,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 53, "text": "Иначе умрешь!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 54, "text": "Гляди: тебѣ нужно дойти до конца."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 55, "text": "Справишься —"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 56, "text": "Продолжимъ игру!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 57, "text": "Ну чего стоишь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 58, "text": "Бѣги, малышъ, бѣги!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Ready recorder - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 61, "text": "Оу!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 62, "text": "Ты такой послушный!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 63, "text": "Отличный экземпляръ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 64, "text": "Хочу тебя себѣ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 65, "text": "Хотя это было суперъ просто, не правда ли?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 66, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 67, "text": "Отпусти меня!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 68, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 69, "text": "Не разслабляйся!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 70, "text": "У насъ еще уйма игръ впереди!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 71, "text": "Итакъ! // Close eyes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 72, "text": "Теперь я буду закрывать глаза."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 73, "text": "И когда открою, // open eyes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 74, "text": "Отъ тебя не должно быть ни слуху, ни духу!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 75, "text": "Понялъ меня?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 76, "text": "Если увижу — накажу!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 77, "text": "Окей, начнемъ!)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 78, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 79, "text": "Это безполезно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Ready hide - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 82, "text": "Добрался!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 83, "text": "Ну ты молодецъ! Это будоражитъ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 84, "text": "Теперь будетъ сложнѣе! "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 85, "text": "Во мно-ого разъ сложнѣе..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 86, "text": "Прячься! Бѣги! А потомъ покрутись!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 88, "text": "Чертъ тебя дери!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 90, "text": "// Player fall - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 91, "text": "Кажется, пронесло… "}
